# Pointer to the real music project (machine-local, never tracked)
.asset

# Disposable work for a session: handoffs, notes, probe scripts and what they
# generate — constructed Takes, rendered audio, a venv. Never project record:
# a probe's recipe goes in its issue, and a script that has to survive is
# promoted to `docs/` or `tests/` by a decision. Out of the crate too, because
# the manifest's `include` list does not name it — not because it is ignored
# here; `cargo package` stops reading this file once `include` is set.
.scratch/

